WEBVTT

00:07:28.782 --> 00:07:30.428
and angrier

00:07:30.452 --> 00:07:31.747
and angrier.

00:07:32.723 --> 00:07:35.726
And he pulled the gun out
and put it in my face.

00:07:37.076 --> 00:07:39.976
I remember every one of us
got very, very quiet.

00:07:40.905 --> 00:07:44.578
I remember the tightness of his face.

00:07:44.602 --> 00:07:46.995
I remember the barrel of the gun.

00:07:47.721 --> 00:07:49.154
And I felt like --

00:07:49.178 --> 00:07:52.646
and I'm pretty sure everyone around me
who got quiet felt like --

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:54.765
"This is the moment I die."

00:07:56.735 --> 00:08:00.226
And the third thing I feel
very, very strongly about